      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "4cae4131fd27f2d069d7ab0c52a8dfbada8dcadb9db72d4648215bef4b5170d5",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c995e5758b67a445faca93b0cff3e65f4cab519419116c82b922f9bcfff349d",
      "text": "The Fast Model Approach",
      "hash": "60df551c7f47b3d215b6bf991f3f3c25cbc44c1c90d500340b215764d7635d27"
    },
    {
      "id": "b159949ecb1da3925bc868f220f9d86fd80e28a3b05e4ec8a9485dca47538894",
      "text": "Alternative Approaches",
      "hash": "176117b86397b37ade446207420a017164ebd50e30d16c0ca96ea802069a6c79"
    },
    {
      "id": "6401c3171d9ddbb59e132b0a2f4294a28fde9d7ddcd2fe9a89fba2e58093444b",
      "text": "Streaming Text to the Frontend",
      "hash": "40e51828b49af1f78cb149ee0799989996c9bded8070a20309c3af932fbc9106"
    },
    {
      "id": "238f78c36a310a7e7c13aaf99033a1c70018d1ded26a98fcf2b373d71266a30e",
      "text": "Continuing with Normal Streaming",
      "hash": "420aa1de7801ba9e5d3a500c821f061f8a5189da09c1f8848faff17c2914d55e"
    },
    {
      "id": "aca74c4155aeb4353824d179cbee1aa6997dbab0efcfcb38141466970d5ba4e6",
      "text": "Applications of Fast LLM Responses",
      "hash": "0d74b2b8ab0b46e07c0c934b7180f8233d5a27d569c1cf1973f743ad158a63eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "c77ae64cbfe41b98e210ab3d57a22438004e0b0e4e462dabff16c244c186f627",
      "text": "Related reading",
      "hash": "89c21c36ad5ffbab7b05ced367c46013c8d7b8ddf53a8b9739b7b2545f78abee"
    },
    {
      "id": "22e9f4c78a5e19dc7269c91cc8f1dd25ed90a630ab12ada031d001892be2df2f",
      "text": "Here's a pattern for validating incoming requests to your LLM application to make sure that they're safe. We're in TypeScript and we're using the AI SDK.",
      "hash": "97e34cf37fe10cecbaf0b835acd1fbd34316dfa17e6bdaf305b65936b9502052"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc347fa10c4b1f0523c02762ce5fb34100f30c42cd3cbf2611c31681a5601d4a",
      "text": "The juiciest nugget is inside the",
      "hash": "60de98c69cf57e005dca531fb0c4e8fd8d3c48aba9c9154f6059881c8dd39ba0"
    },
    {
      "id": "7475ff5aad045a2dadf39826b1bd9dbc008ca58783a80ed8b352bddb9c02e5cc",
      "text": "function. The idea here is that we use a very, very fast model, in this case Gemini 2.0 Flash Lite.",
      "hash": "b47a1f1389813e4f325b6083b13c6bf4c5d5332d03cf62c40f0ee533777b743b"
    },
    {
      "id": "987c00f77429f7e472e5ce9e8ba3a21524b2c8c72c806eec1168c091b9b2871e",
      "text": "We pass it all of the messages in the conversation history so far, and we get it to run extremely quickly by only returning a single token. This is done inside the guardrail",
      "hash": "0f60eac3070274a7526e4df3d048af53123efcbb10f993a9869381d2897af884"
    },
    {
      "id": "db32df6f12f2630b86e58a71b9f5d2b51d9288e26d3bf324c0ec34dbac83ee76",
      "text": "system prompt",
      "hash": "e16202309c92180728dd7fd1c59f16004a6d5ee245538c28d2a9a22edf2dd2ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "1754837312542a78cc80f1bfdef4705091b8e0f3caaccf8f3d186cce06481471",
      "text": "Because it's just returning a single token, this will run very, very quickly. And it means that we can do some imperative logic here, saying if the text is exactly",
      "hash": "de178f01856adadb2dbd3342b3dd2350d3c87cc41b93b133005fb74337b75685"
    },
    {
      "id": "abb059291db7bfbc96b0637fc4f1c7c8e597b13ac0f175a1eb0bda68e1de46a3",
      "text": ", then the request is safe, so we can return",
      "hash": "f1e47dc3f5c67da23913fc02f80352d3db0ec3b98d2d4b78b8079a666191d40c"
    },
    {
      "id": "399519786d5e5d440fa2d04ebaeb01ac2df0a4884c20af64334d6f6b5560c244",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "27a255a9181a36d6d67905c9743cdd0a37f23662669d5d9e0a6ec1be405cc0a9",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "57d82a30ed596cfa88aa74840332e51ae7c9f33e6a78882d8cb273099e156474",
      "text": "Lots of folks pointed out in the comments it doesn't have to be",
      "hash": "a0dc80854ccced162ad67b8d1c821122a35e7c7a730b9b0df81e3610c7a54bd1"
    },
    {
      "id": "709fb9a1c74d8e33039127cfbb1a2bafcec309921562ef6d858f017cf86a7e9e",
      "text": ", you can use a single word. Since for the LLM it's actually generating tokens under the hood, numbers.",
      "hash": "d9a345e055778872d7d2280a34ab81b21ffef3be16ca3918d76e526e4a8cd400"
    },
    {
      "id": "adf968dd08769bb9067e0d42ec12c396970a90c14ea3793286ccf06e07ee5713",
      "text": "So it would take exactly the same amount of time for it to generate the word \"safe\" as it would to generate the word \"one\", but this is the implementation I landed on and it works pretty well.",
      "hash": "5ed1373bd21e4bf64b4a5421d9e62ac9576057845e87dc54237259fa45619629"
    },
    {
      "id": "9713b85b4350f62043560e5b124ad2e3c9079f2acad3ee6e834b9e0641e3e412",
      "text": "Next we should look at this",
      "hash": "5bd4f448e7f3d8485f1dccfa633675375d71f4d25294e8f1703ad978cde1b19c"
    },
    {
      "id": "451c5253e7c0d46667bbb758e4063398e57d8b16bc0c3cc9e7ecf068a4ca0d6e",
      "text": "function. It's useful any time that you need to stream any arbitrary text to the front end.",
      "hash": "ced251745d0d0f2d64754da6fedf24fb720e96a908b47a3eaf11fd65ace18e5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "fe16f4581bd36f21d9b2c2e55bb1d6184ab436695244ae66f335b5044aba1e4d",
      "text": "Here we're streaming three parts,",
      "hash": "d16ce8d8c0c7978a41d69b494d6f35c8dccb174233e5179b113cacc7417595de"
    },
    {
      "id": "b525e38b18bff28f51a4c452641f5d6fc52f6f0cde6f52bf280c3f91007966f0",
      "text": ", all with the same",
      "hash": "92eb9c5108ae49e722940bbb372be7c245b81a66f30df64f64db44f1ed5b8a2e"
    },
    {
      "id": "239f136b65b1d9e75ff4be9effdfbb9bed7da81896a82ee78011cbecc104449f",
      "text": ". To be honest it's pretty verbose and I wish the AI SDK would make this a little bit easier, since all we need to do is really stream this message to the frontend.",
      "hash": "4aab8c473b339ccb953c5b50899882caa94228bc38ab51e320b5e16c775aa3af"
    },
    {
      "id": "679691505da785c1bec22ec7760166e1adfa2713135f9c894cef0bb51518f4d9",
      "text": "Finally then we continue streaming with the writer and with the model messages.",
      "hash": "db14ce42bd350cce3780229f095891e4da9aeb60a9b4f7462434904e01b312ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e837ca7f16b46458d539818861325a32f51dfd1844f116660f214debe848963",
      "text": "This is a normal",
      "hash": "9fde852a20926ff02463ebb433d165231a898e88cbddc58afc1d4e6bdab41cf0"
    },
    {
      "id": "67ced975f5c8506a4bee11e82047fde96f8989d38f33db62a72a8639b375ba74",
      "text": "call where we're merging it into the writer.",
      "hash": "9364280935850071bae05ccfe30f4ad51a2efee6bd1320bc122928c1f4f4c1bf"
    },
    {
      "id": "1e7b70aedae491272f7fa364c26f4da1c51fcbd7cd1cdb3597b799d02621a782",
      "text": "This logic of a very, very fast LLM response for the rest of your logic is something that we can map into lots of different use cases:",
      "hash": "89147acb334a06ea58a5ddaf9fafb16857aa143103714e511bc06f01312a1219"
    },
    {
      "id": "2ed6a84862240838f9ae391080957bb4c0b372910a6dee6f3d97c3264ef4a68c",
      "text": "We could use this as a router to route certain requests through a smarter LLM",
      "hash": "bcdcef797723b80dc8a88ccb916061cc714de141256e645d744028a6d602d25e"
    },
    {
      "id": "04802d8587eec3babddb7d337bb9e24b53e164f2df7568d1bec693163f05d948",
      "text": "Or route simple ones to a stupid fast LLM, which would be an amazingly cost-saving measure",
      "hash": "8f63e83ff274a6b786a1c4a9b115efea69687c6ba6e94503d8500d6682e89f86"
    },
    {
      "id": "a910b1fce28bdf0d042b8d3897709b782849bcf53949ffe86d0008fadbd8993e",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7c3939f37016bff8e214c2ef8b1c48d8af0cce16c14fbca31b3982bfeaa1f64",
      "text": "Share on Bluesky",
      "hash": "08863b88a05c60410c38c4caec5bc72535b0f01793ce6cee9171b6358b2c11da"
    },
    {
      "id": "a994fbe5e8c44965b93d3dfa9a0d30c424ed82978abba6dd2697c3f90e129f9d",
      "text": "Share on LinkedIn",
      "hash": "ab87c050148bd1d372e3ec3483a606127a7a1faec0f1ca5543bc3465d84fe6c9"
    },
    {
